sequenceDiagram
 actor U as User
 participant S as Supervisor
 participant P as Planner 0.8B
 participant M as Dated memory
 participant W as Writer 2B or 4B
 participant V as Verifier 4B
 U->>S: Question and effective date
 S->>P: Plan query with scoped history
 P-->>S: Query and complexity proposal
 S->>M: search_documents then read_section
 M-->>S: Valid sources with IDs and hashes
 S->>W: Select verbatim evidence
 W-->>S: Claims and abstention flag
 S->>S: Check schema IDs and exact quote matches
 alt Valid nonempty candidate
  S->>V: Check relevance completeness and dates
  V-->>S: Approval or rejection
 end
 opt Rejection with repair budget remaining
  S->>W: One repair using 4B
  W-->>S: Revised candidate
  S->>S: Repeat deterministic gate
  S->>V: Recheck revised evidence
  V-->>S: Verdict
 end
 S->>M: Store scoped episode status
 S-->>U: Approved quotations or abstention
 Note over S,V: At most five model calls and one repair
